'''Dalithoy''', also known as '''daali toy''', is [[soup]] made with split yellow [[lentil]]s in the [[Malvani cuisine]] of the [[Konkan]] region of India. ''Daali'' is the [[Konkani language|Konkani]] word for ''daal'' or lentil.
